{"title": "Elixir of Acid Resistance", "pageid": 3781, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Elixir_of_Acid_Resistance", "categories": ["Elixirs", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ELX_Elixir_of_Acid_Resistance_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/ELX_Elixir_of_Acid_Resistance_Faded.png/300px-ELX_Elixir_of_Acid_Resistance_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/1/12/ELX_Elixir_of_Acid_Resistance_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Elixir of Acid Resistance image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/ELX_Elixir_of_Acid_Resistance_Faded.png/300px-ELX_Elixir_of_Acid_Resistance_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/12/ELX_Elixir_of_Acid_Resistance_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #FFFFFF ;\">Elixir of Acid Resistance</span></a> is an uncommon <a href=\"/wiki/Elixirs\" title=\"Elixirs\">Elixir</a> that grants <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid\" title=\"Acid\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Acid_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Acid_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image li